			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Correct ExtensionState path in ScanAndPopulateExtensions\n\nUpdate the type signature for `ScanAndPopulateExtensions` and `ScanExtensionsWithRecovery` in `ScanAndPopulateExtensions.rs` to reflect the new canonical module hierarchy. Replace the deprecated `ExtensionState::State::State` path with `State::ExtensionState::State::State`.\n\nThis adjustment ensures consistent symbol resolution following the recent flattening of the `ExtensionState` and `ApplicationState` modules, aligning with the decomposition pattern applied to `LifecyclePhase`, `Decorations`, and `Keybindings` in previous commits.",
