			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Flatten Keybindings module structure\n\nRemove the wildcard re-export pattern in `Keybindings/mod.rs` and retain only the module declaration for `KeybindingState`. Add `#![allow(non_snake_case)]` and update documentation to reflect the canonical symbol resolution path `Keybindings::KeybindingState::{KeybindingEntry, KeybindingState}`.\n\nThis aligns with the ongoing decomposition of `FeatureState` into file-per-struct PascalCase modules, ensuring consistency with recent flattening of `Decorations`, `LifecyclePhase`, `ScannedExtensions`, `ExtensionRegistry`, and `ProviderRegistration`.",
