			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Flatten LifecyclePhase module structure\n\nRemove extensive header documentation and flatten the `LifecyclePhase` module hierarchy in `ApplicationState`. Replace the previous dual-module pattern (`mod.rs` re-exporting `LifecyclePhaseState.rs`) with a single canonical path where the struct resides in `LifecyclePhaseState/LifecyclePhaseState.rs`.\n\nThis aligns with the ongoing decomposition of `FeatureState` into file-per-struct PascalCase modules, ensuring consistent symbol resolution for the boot-phase state used during Mountain initialization.",
